          <div class="prose">
            <p>Hackmamba was known for technical content, but the work had grown into launches, communities, paid media and events. Across our client work, one stage of the developer journey kept being left to chance.</p>
            <p>So I built the Developer Adoption Architecture (DAA) and led Hackmamba’s rebrand into a full-cycle developer growth agency. DAA changed the first question we ask clients. Instead of “What services do you need?” we ask “Where is adoption getting stuck?”</p>
